Package: retrobox-mangohud
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Manu Romero <manu-romero-411@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: libdbus-1-3, libx11-6, libvulkan1
Homepage: https://github.com/manu-romero-411/retrobox-mangohud
Description: MangoHud with background image support, for Retrobox
 MangoHud built with the Retrobox patches (background_image/image) in a
 private prefix, /opt/retrobox/resources/mangohud, with its own Vulkan layer
 (VK_LAYER_RETROBOX_MANGOHUD_*) switched on by RETROBOX_MANGOHUD=1.
 .
 It does not replace, nor conflict with, the MangoHud package of the
 distribution: both can be installed at the same time.
